The synthetic path passed, and the first real-anchor smoke run is now exercising the exact stage-4h reference physics. One accounting detail surfaced only in synthetic mode (its scalar fallback counts physical boundaries, not configurations); real anchors use the dense array path where selection evaluations are one-to-one with unique configuration IDs, which is the requested cost measure.
